{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "种子只有32位",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 58.82,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2022 年 9 月，Wintermute 的金库被盗，约 1.6 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 9 月，Wintermute 的金库被盗，约 1.6 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 1.703,
   "speechEnd": 6.529
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "这个金库的地址，是用一个叫 Profanity 的靶号工具生成的。",
   "spoken": "这个金库的地址，是用一个叫 Profanity 的靶号工具生成的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 6.94,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 6.94,
   "speechEnd": 11.263
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "靶号地址，就是首尾字符符合指定模式的地址。比如开头是一串 0。",
   "spoken": "靶号地址，就是首尾字符符合指定模式的地址。比如开头是一串 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 11.64,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 11.737,
   "speechEnd": 17.72
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "私钥有 256 位，按理说，没人猜得出来。",
   "spoken": "私钥有 256 位，按理说，没人猜得出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 18.18,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 18.18,
   "speechEnd": 22.69
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "可这个工具的随机数，只用了一个 32 位的种子。",
   "spoken": "可这个工具的随机数，只用了一个 32 位的种子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 23.12,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 23.12,
   "speechEnd": 28.083
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "32 位种子，只有约 43 亿种可能。",
   "spoken": "32 位种子，只有约 43 亿种可能。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 28.54,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 28.54,
   "speechEnd": 32.652
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "做个示例计算。如果每秒试 10 亿个种子，全部试完，最多约 4.3 秒。",
   "spoken": "做个示例计算。如果每秒试 10 亿个种子，全部试完，最多约 4.3 秒。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 33.08,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 33.08,
   "speechEnd": 39.676
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "真实攻击还要从种子算出地址，会慢一些。但一张 GPU，几分钟就够。",
   "spoken": "真实攻击还要从种子算出地址，会慢一些。但一张 GPU，几分钟就够。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 40.1,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 40.199,
   "speechEnd": 45.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "那么问题来了。一把 256 位的私钥，为什么只值 32 位？",
   "spoken": "那么问题来了。一把 256 位的私钥，为什么只值 32 位？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 46.32,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 46.414,
   "speechEnd": 51.514
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "这一集，我们讲私钥从哪里来，又是怎么被算出来的。",
   "spoken": "这一集，我们讲私钥从哪里来，又是怎么被算出来的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
